    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512">

                <pb facs="0943" n="839" xml:id="pg839"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt
                    Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prime Minister Churchill to President Roosevelt</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-12-09">December 9 (?), 1943</date>.]<anchor n="1"
                            xml:id="d512-f1"/></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>509. Prime Minister to President Roosevelt. Most secret and personal.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>I gave the paper in my immediately following to Inönü.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d512-f2"/> They have asked for 4
                        days in which to consult their Parliament but meanwhile will allow build up
                        to begin and 250 specialists are starting forthwith. On the whole I am
                        hopeful. Vyshinsky liked the
                        layout.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>… I am tidying up with the King of Greece and expect a solution and
                        arrangement in harmony with your feelings.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d512-f3"/>
                        Every good wish to you and Harry.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d512-f1" n="1" xml:id="d512-f1-content">
                <p>Sent by the United States Military Attaché London, at 9:48 a.m. on December 9,
                    1943. The time of origination in Cairo does not appear on the source text.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d512-f2" n="2" xml:id="d512-f2-content">
                <p>Annex A to the minutes of the Churchill-Inönü meeting of
                    December 7, 1943, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg755">p.
                        755</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d512-f3" n="3" xml:id="d512-f3-content">
                <p>See <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg844">pp. 844</ref>, <ref
                        target="#pg850">850</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
